@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor "读者\n(学生/教师)" as Reader
actor "图书管理员" as Librarian
actor "智能助手\n(系统参与者)" as Assistant
actor "图书馆集成系统\n(外部系统)" as ILS

rectangle "借阅流通子系统" {
  usecase "UC-03 续借图书" as UC03
  usecase "身份认证" as UC_Auth
  usecase "查询借阅记录" as UC_Query
  usecase "校验续借资格" as UC_Check
  usecase "计算新应还日期" as UC_Calc
  usecase "提交续借事务" as UC_Commit
  usecase "返回续借结果" as UC_Result
}

Reader --> UC03
Librarian --> UC03
Assistant --> UC03

UC03 ..> UC_Auth : <<include>>
UC03 ..> UC_Query : <<include>>
UC03 ..> UC_Check : <<include>>
UC03 ..> UC_Calc : <<include>>
UC03 ..> UC_Commit : <<include>>
UC03 ..> UC_Result : <<include>>

UC_Query --> ILS : 查询借阅记录
UC_Commit --> ILS : 续借事务

note right of UC_Check
  BR-01 学生≤2次 / 教师≤5次
  BR-03 有他人预约 → 拒绝
  BR-04 已逾期 → 拒绝
  BR-05 不改变预约队列位次
end note

note right of UC_Calc
  BR-02 顺延 30 天
end note

@enduml
